        The <em>Yes or No Wheel</em>: A Practical Guide to
        <em>Breaking Decision Deadlock</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        A two-option decision should be the easiest kind you make all day. So
        why does it sometimes take three days to answer? Here's what's actually
        happening psychologically — and the specific situations where a Yes or
        No Wheel genuinely resolves it.
      </p>
      <div class="post-meta">
        <span>🔄 Updated November 24, 2026</span><span class="meta-dot">·</span>
        <span>⏱ 10 min read</span>
      </div>
      <div class="updated-badge">✅ Last reviewed: November 24, 2026</div>

      <div class="hero-img-wrap">
        <img
