        <!-- ═══ SECTION 4 ═══ -->
        <h2 id="when-use">
          4. Eight Situations Where a Yes or No Wheel Genuinely Helps
        </h2>

        <p>
          The wheel isn't the right tool for every decision — Section 6 covers
          when to put it away. But for the eight situations below, it's a
          genuinely effective circuit-breaker. They share one trait: the person
          already has enough information to decide, but is stuck in a loop
          driven by emotion or identity, not missing facts.
        </p>

        <div class="idea-grid">
          <div class="idea-card">
