                <li>
                  It's a group tie-break where visible fairness matters more
                  than the specific outcome
                </li>
                <li>You want to surface a genuine gut preference quickly</li>
                <li>It's a trivial daily choice draining mental bandwidth</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="ds-no">
              <div class="ds-label">❌ Skip the Wheel When…</div>
              <ul>
                <li>The decision has major, hard-to-reverse consequences</li>
                <li>You're missing information you haven't gone and found</li>
                <li>
                  Someone else is affected and deserves a voice in the process
                </li>
                <li>
                  You already know the answer and are just avoiding acting on it
                </li>
                <li>The decision carries real moral or ethical weight</li>
                <li>
                  You want to keep spinning until you get your preferred result
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>


